{
  "name": "KebunData Threads - Token Exchanger & Setup Assistant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔑 How to Get Your Long-Term Threads API Credentials\n\n1. **Go to Meta Developers**: Open [developers.facebook.com](https://developers.facebook.com) > Apps.\n2. **Select Meta App**: App ID `1481860783589362` (`Ak.Kamil Automation`).\n3. **Add Threads Tester Role**: In **Roles** > **Roles**, add your Threads account as Tester and accept in Threads App settings.\n4. **Generate Short-Lived Token**: In **Threads API** > **Tools**, check all permissions and click **Generate Token**.\n5. **Paste Token**: Double-click the **Input Threads Credentials** node below and paste your Short-Lived Token into `short_lived_token`.\n6. **Run Workflow**: Click **Execute Workflow**.\n7. **Copy Result**: The final node will output your **Threads User ID** and **60-Day Long-Lived Access Token** formatted for `.env`!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-0001",
      "name": "Setup Instructions Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
